# The demo corpus is generated, not stored.
#
# `DemoCorpusGenerator` (backend test sources) writes these seven files from builders the suite
# already trusts — `TestPdfs` and `TestOfficeFiles` — so committing them would add binaries to the
# repository that it would then have no way to explain. The generator is the record of how they were
# made; the bytes are a build artifact.
#
#     cd backend
#     ./mvnw -o test -Dtest=DemoCorpusGenerator -Ddemo.corpus=true
#
# `seed.ps1` beside this file is tracked, because that one is source.
corpus/
